# Your personal configuration — never committed.
# The tracked reference copy is system/config.example.md
system/config.md

# Obsidian local state — ignored in full.
# Workspace layout, cache, and graph settings are machine-local, and the folder
# also accumulates plugin config you may not have inspected. If you deliberately
# want to share Obsidian settings, un-ignore the specific files you have read.
.obsidian/

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
.trash/
Thumbs.db

# Secrets — never belong in the vault at all, but block them here too
*.env
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Opt-in privacy: uncomment any of these to keep that layer out of git.
#
# Trade-off: raw/ is your evidence base. Excluding it means your citations
# point at files that exist on one machine only. Read system/PRIVACY.md first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# raw/
# inbox/
# wiki/
